#### 1. `user_memory` - Профили и история пользователей

```sql
CREATE TABLE user_memory (
    user_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,
    full_name TEXT,
    phone TEXT,
    selected_service TEXT,
    conversation_history JSONB DEFAULT '[]',
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW(),
